# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Node, though there are no dependencies to install
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Where CI points CLAUDEMON_HOME, so the sprites it downloads land somewhere it can
# cache by a relative path. Only ever written by .github/workflows/ci.yml.
.claudemon-ci/

# Nothing the game writes is in here — saves, config, sprites and the PokeAPI
# response cache all live under ~/.claudemon. Two things that look ignorable and
# are not:
#
#   data/  the dataset the plugin ships, so installing needs no PokeAPI round trip
#   docs/  the screenshots the README shows, and the landing page GitHub Pages serves
